## Database
{% endif %}
{% if goose %}

Migrations in `database/migrations` are managed with [goose](https://github.com/pressly/goose),
configured through the `GOOSE_*` variables in `.env`:

```sh
{{ runner }} migrate-up       # apply pending migrations
{{ runner }} migrate-down     # roll back the latest migration
{{ runner }} migrate-status
{% if runner_make %}
make migrate-new name=add_email
{% elif runner_just %}
just migrate-new add_email
{% else %}
task migrate-new -- add_email
{% endif %}
```
{% endif %}
{% if sqlc %}

[sqlc](https://sqlc.dev) generates type-safe Go code in `database/store` from the
queries in `database/queries` and the schema in `database/{% if sql_schema_file %}schema.sql{% else %}migrations{% endif %}`.
Run `{{ runner }} sqlc` after changing either, and use the result through
`database.New().Queries()`.
{% endif %}

